# 🦷 Dental AI — Project TODO List

## 🚨 HIGH PRIORITY — Admin Approval Platform
> Jab bhi naya user register kare, seedha access mat do — pehle Admin approve kare!

### 🗄️ Database Changes
- [ ] **User model mein `status` field add karo** — `PENDING | APPROVED | REJECTED`
- [ ] **Admin model banana hai** — Ek alag `Admin` table ya `User` mein `role` field (`USER | ADMIN`)
- [ ] **Prisma migration run karo** — Schema update ke baad `prisma migrate dev`

### 🔐 Auth / Access Control
- [ ] **Registration flow update** — Naya user register kare toh `status: PENDING` set ho
- [ ] **Login check** — Login pe check karo: agar `status !== APPROVED` toh access block karo
- [ ] **Middleware/Guard** — Protected routes pe `PENDING` users ko rok ke "Awaiting Approval" page dikhao
- [ ] **Session mein status store karo** — NextAuth session mein `status` aur `role` include karo

### 📧 Notifications
- [ ] **Admin ko email** — Naya user register hone pe Admin ko notification email bhejo
- [ ] **User ko email** — Jab Admin approve/reject kare tab user ko email aaye

### 🖥️ Admin Dashboard (New Page)
- [ ] **`/admin` page banana hai** — Sirf Admin role waale access kar sake
- [ ] **Pending Users List** — Sabhi `PENDING` users ki list dikhao (naam, college, ID card)
- [ ] **Approve / Reject Button** — Admin ek click mein approve ya reject kar sake
- [ ] **ID Card Preview** — Admin uploaded college ID card dekh sake before approving
- [ ] **Approved/Rejected History** — Purane decisions ka log rakho

### 🤖 AI Model Switcher (Admin Control)
> Admin dashboard pe ek toggle/button hoga jisse Admin decide karega ki system kaunsa AI use kare!

- [ ] **DB mein `activeModel` setting store karo** — Ek `SystemConfig` table banao jisme `activeModel` field ho (`GOOGLE_AI | MOCK_AI | OWN_AI`)
- [ ] **Admin Dashboard pe Model Selector UI** — Teen cards/buttons banao:
  - 🔵 **Google AI (Gemini)** — Real Google Gemini API use karega
  - 🟡 **Mock AI** — Fake/demo response dega (testing ke liye)
  - 🟢 **Own AI (Custom Model)** — Apna trained dental model use karega
- [ ] **Active model highlight karo** — Jo model selected ho woh glowing/active dikhe
- [ ] **API Route banao** — `/api/admin/set-model` — Admin ka choice DB mein save ho
- [ ] **AI Router banao** — `/api/analyze` mein pehle DB se `activeModel` check karo, phir accordingly call karo
- [ ] **Users ko pata na chale** — Backend pe silently switch ho, user ko same UI dikhe

### 👤 User Side
- [ ] **"Awaiting Approval" Page** — Register karne ke baad user ko dikhao ki request pending hai
- [ ] **Rejection Message** — Reject hone pe reason dikhao
- [ ] **Re-apply Option** — Reject hone pe user dobara apply kar sake

